# DalaranCircleOfWills - Dalaran (Northrend), the Underbelly's central hall, Circle of Wills (area 4570, flags 0x40004968: duel + sanctuary).
# The Underbelly corridors (area 4560) are NOT duel-legal. Zone 4395 is in PvpProhibitedZoneIds, so this spot needs
# AllowPvpProhibitedZone = 1.
# A spot with AllowPvpProhibitedZone = 1 inside a PvP-prohibited zone also relaxes AC's "no hostile target around" rule of
# the duel request: the Underbelly holds dozens of hostile units 39+ yd away, so only a hostile within 25 yd blocks a
# request there (wave 13: every scan stopped at that rule). Every other spot keeps AC's rule unchanged.
# Source: Wowpedia "Underbelly" / "Circle of Wills" (dueling circles).
