####################################################################################################

###################################
#                                 #
# PREMADE SPECS                   #
#                                 #
###################################

###################################################################################################
# INFORMATION
#
#

# AiPlayerbot.PremadeSpecName.<class>.<specno> = <name>    #Name of the talent specialisation
# AiPlayerbot.PremadeSpecLink.<class>.<specno> = <tiers>   #5.4.8 talents: one character per tier (levels 15,30,45,60,75,90),
#                                                           #0-2 = Talent.dbc column (left, middle, right), any other character
#                                                           #(e.g. ".") = no preference: the bot picks that tier at random
# AiPlayerbot.PremadeSpecGlyph.<class>.<specno> = <major 1>,<minor 1>,<major 2>,<minor 2>,<minor 3>,<major 3>   #ItemId of the glyphs
#                                                           #each glyph goes to the first free unlocked slot of its type (major/minor);
#                                                           #slots unlock in pairs at 25/50/75; an unconfigured slot gets a random class glyph
# PremadeSpecName is a label only (nothing in the code reads it). Where 5.4.8 has the same specialization as AC the label is AC's
# (prot pve, bm pve, ...); monk and druid keep the full 5.4.8 names because their spec layout differs from WotLK.
# <specno> is the 5.4.8 specialization tab (ChrSpecialization TabPage): 0-2, druid 0-3. Monk: 0 brewmaster, 1 mistweaver,
# 2 windwalker. Druid: 0 balance, 1 feral, 2 guardian, 3 restoration.
# #734 defaults: talents and major glyphs from the MoP Classic class guides at https://wowtbc.gg/mop/class-guides/<spec>/
# (fetched 2026-10-08); minor glyphs the guides do not list are utility/cosmetic picks so every slot is configured.
# The previous entries were AzerothCore WotLK talent-calculator links, which the 5.4.8 talent system cannot use.

#
#
#
###################################################################################################

###################################################################################################
# WARRIOR
#
#

# arms: Juggernaut / Enraged Regeneration / Piercing Howl / Bladestorm / Vigilance / Bloodbath
